  "title": "MasTec to Host Investor Day in New York City Today at 8:45 AM ET",
  "summary": "CORAL GABLES, Fla. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 12, 2026-- MasTec, Inc. (NYSE: MTZ) will host an in-person, invitation-only, Investor Day in New York City today beginning at 8:45 a.m. ET, as previously announced. The event is expected to conclude at approximately 12:00 p.m. ET.",
